		(uuid "22b0d0e1-71a8-400d-b289-864cd95325b0")
	)
	(text "I am leaning toward replacing this relatively primative\nOP07 with an OPA197. It's JFET input stage, low offset\nvoltage, and rail-to-rail outputs are compelling selling\npoints."
